%%{init: {'theme':'neutral', 'sequence': {'mirrorActors': false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor N as NGO
  participant B as Browser
  participant F as Flask app
  participant M as MongoDB Atlas
  participant S as Stripe

  rect rgb(243,246,252)
  Note over N,S: 1. Create and publish a campaign
  N->>B: Fill in campaign form (title, goal, photos, needed items)
  B->>F: POST /campaign-create
  F->>F: Validate fields and image types
  F->>M: Save photos to GridFS (media)
  F->>M: campaigns.insert_one(status active, confirmed false)
  M-->>F: campaign_id
  F-->>B: Redirect to /campaign-preview/<id>
  N->>B: Check preview, click Confirm
  B->>F: POST /campaign-confirm/<id>
  F->>M: campaigns.update_one(confirmed true)
  F->>M: users.update_one($push campaigns)
  F->>M: updates.insert_one (campaign is live)
  F-->>B: Redirect to profile, "Fundraiser created successfully"
  end

  rect rgb(246,250,243)
  Note over N,S: 2. Review equipment parcels
  N->>B: Open equipment parcels
  B->>F: GET /ngo-equipment/<campaign_id>?status=shipped
  F->>M: donations.find(equipment, shipped)
  M-->>F: parcels
  F-->>B: Render ngo_equipment.html
  N->>B: Mark parcel received or rejected
  B->>F: POST /ngo-equipment/<donation_id>/<action>
  F->>M: donations.update_one(status received or rejected)
  F->>M: audit_logs.insert_one
  F->>M: updates.insert_one (notify donor) + users.update_one(tier)
  F-->>B: Flash result and reload list
  end

  rect rgb(252,247,240)
  Note over N,S: 3. Connect Stripe and claim payout
  N->>B: Click Set up payouts
  B->>F: POST /connect-onboard
  F->>S: Create connected account + account link
  S-->>F: account_id, onboarding URL
  F->>M: users.update_one(stripe_account_id)
  F-->>B: Redirect to Stripe onboarding
  N->>S: Complete onboarding
  S-->>B: Redirect to /ngo/connect/return
  N->>B: Click Claim payout
  B->>F: POST /ngo/payouts/claim
  F->>S: Check transfers capability is active
  F->>M: donations.update_many(unpaid to claimed, batch id)
  F->>M: payouts.insert_one(status processing)
  F->>S: transfers.create(amount, MYR, destination)
  alt transfer succeeds
    S-->>F: transfer id
    F->>M: donations.update_many(paid) + payouts.update_one(completed)
    F-->>B: "RM ... is on its way!"
  else StripeError
    F->>M: donations.update_many(back to unpaid) + payouts.update_one(failed)
    F-->>B: "Payout failed"
  end
  B-->>N: Show payout status on dashboard
  end
